                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "35ce2319-7a39-3d6a-ae99-9d37f977e988",
                        "entry_id": "4407a4e7-d35f-3aed-900d-f005169ca8cf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "使迷惑，使困惑，使迷失"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5316050d-532b-4e5a-9584-ba971db33d4e",
                                "sense_id": "35ce2319-7a39-3d6a-ae99-9d37f977e988",
                                "text": "Now, to smother noise and light,\nIs stolen abroad the wildering night",
                                "translation": "現在，為了掩蓋喧囂與光芒，\n令人迷惘的黑夜悄然降臨"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "002cc29a-1a32-49b1-b224-7ac11f72ac4b",
                                "sense_id": "35ce2319-7a39-3d6a-ae99-9d37f977e988",
                                "text": "Now in their hearts those wildered Trojans said That once more they beheld Achilles' self Gigantic in his armour.",
                                "translation": "現在，那些困惑的特洛伊人在心裡說，他們再次看到了穿著鎧甲、身形巨大的阿基里斯本人。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0fda6e0a-eb7b-401b-9dd9-d760bdd583c3",
                                "sense_id": "35ce2319-7a39-3d6a-ae99-9d37f977e988",
                                "text": "More tender, grateful than she could have dreamed, Fond hands passed pitying over brows and hair, And gentle words borne softly through the air, Calming her weary sense and wildered mind, By welcome, dear communion with her kind.",
                                "translation": "比她夢想的還要溫柔且充滿感激，充滿愛意的手憐憫地撫過她的眉毛和頭髮，溫和的話語輕柔地在空中傳播，透過與同類受歡迎的、親切的交流，平靜了她疲憊的感官和迷惘的心靈。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ad131da-3004-4bc9-9329-74aaf0d051fd",
                                "sense_id": "35ce2319-7a39-3d6a-ae99-9d37f977e988",
                                "text": "Deep and far within the ether stretched my eyes their anxious gaze, While the swelling thoughts within me grew a wild and wildered maze, Then came floating on the distance, softly to my listening ears, Low, thrilling harmonies of worlds whirling in their bright spheres.",
                                "translation": "我的雙眼帶著焦慮的目光，深深地、遠遠地凝視著以太，而我內心不斷膨脹的思緒變成了一個狂亂而令人迷惑的迷宮，接著從遠方飄來，輕輕傳入我傾聽的耳中，那是無數世界在明亮天體中旋轉時發出的低沉而動人的和諧樂音。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
